WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.650
In pattern card 1, one equal piece of a shape cut into 2 equal parts is which

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:10.779
fraction? Let us think carefully. A unit fraction is one of 2 equal parts. The answer

00:00:10.779 --> 00:00:12.061
is 1/2. Great work!

